)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to\\subseteq A\\times A\">\\(\\to\\subseteq A\\times A\\)</span>；单关系抽象归约系统见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"89129816153530db\" href=\"?note=89129816153530db\" title=\"56-df-abstract-reduction-system\">56-df-abstract-reduction-system</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leftrightarrow^*\">\\(\\leftrightarrow^*\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9ddd157960e9574a\" href=\"?note=9ddd157960e9574a\" title=\"56-df-relation-closure\">56-df-relation-closure</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Join}\">\\(\\mathrm{Join}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1de67f45113d6dcf\" href=\"?note=1de67f45113d6dcf\" title=\"56-df-joinable\">56-df-joinable</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ChurchRosser}(A,\\to)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall a,b\\in A\\;(a\\leftrightarrow^*b\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Join}(A,\\to,a,b)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ChurchRosser}(A,\\to)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall a,b\\in A\\;(a\\leftrightarrow^*b\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Join}(A,\\to,a,b)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>把可转换性版本与峰形合流版本分开定义，等价性见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"fd3a63cb1c046574\" href=\"?note=fd3a63cb1c046574\" title=\"56-thm-church-rosser-equivalence\">56-thm-church-rosser-equivalence</a>。原书将二者作为可互换的术语。</p>\n<p>来源定位中的 <code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 指本地提取文本的页块序号，不宣称是DjVu物理页码；印刷页已按该页页眉或页脚核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-joinable","status":"resolved","id":"1de67f45113d6dcf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","locati